0a29f449-a0c0-44a7-9f58-ec7f436f2cef	Beautiful Sicily	The SRT travels to Sicily to capture the traitor from the Nanjing operation. Sousuke has difficulties balancing work and school when he tries to have a phone conversation with Kaname and to drive a getaway vehicle at the same time. A mysterious AS also appears to help the team get away. Seeing the stress of his everyday duties, Mao decides to ask Sousuke about his own plans for the future.	25	269c9646-301d-4a05-90d7-4086d9499277	2026-08-27 06:55:46.168+00	2026-08-27 07:42:58.007+00	5	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7zdb4NZIhmALGLSN4qQ9oW4CPI6.jpg	7	2005-08-11 00:00:00+00
