7b3f7287-f324-4772-9f48-506c3094696b	Her Problem	Kaname confronts Agent Wraith about Sousuke's departure, but as she is about to get answers, Xia Yu Lan ambushes the two. Kaname outwits her pursuer until Leonard Testarossa, another Amalgam agent who is also Tessa's brother, shows up and kills Xia Yu Lan. He reveals that the assassin was a rogue agent acting outside of Amalgam's interests.	25	269c9646-301d-4a05-90d7-4086d9499277	2026-08-27 06:55:46.171+00	2026-08-27 07:42:58.009+00	9	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1aX4NxF3EmU4Fg9ztBUkImDV2kW.jpg	7	2005-09-22 00:00:00+00
