a44b7e16-986c-45da-b884-0f5287ae25e6	The Two Aces!!	Kuroda's pulling puts Hakone Academy in the lead as the competitors head towards the first day's finish line, but Sohoku's sprinter turned all-rounder Naruko Shoukichi shows off his strengths! By demonstrating a new special ability that allows him to go quickly even while racing uphill, he doesn't back down from the challenge. Told by Teshima to decide between themselves who will be the ace, Imaizumi and Naruko act more like rivals racing against each other than teammates working together, while Kuroda and Ashikiba demonstrate their battle-hardened coordination. Meanwhile, the shadow approaches from behind both teams...	24	aefead94-1901-46ce-a861-fc4087707454	2026-08-27 06:51:52.839+00	2026-08-27 07:39:43.606+00	2	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iFGbWs6x7ICzUnnhI0O89XnH3zU.jpg	8	2018-01-16 00:00:00+00
cab7ba42-c413-4802-b87b-b19ab9e6a596	The Appointed Time	Sohoku and Hakone Academy are locked in a fierce battle! Just when it looks like the first day's victory will go to one of two teams, Kyoto Fushimi's Midousuji and Kishigami suddenly make a sneak attack from behind!! And the one who responds is...?!	24	aefead94-1901-46ce-a861-fc4087707454	2026-08-27 06:51:52.84+00	2026-08-27 07:39:43.607+00	3	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cFUsQ1b4JWjOOZZxcfOrZHPon6Q.jpg	8	2018-01-23 00:00:00+00
