1ca246e6-84e3-4d0c-8561-64e9610c01ed	Executions and Negotiations	Marc has been thrown into prison for a farce of an offense, and it's up to Sasaki to cook up an otherwordly scheme to get him out... and maybe make a tidy profit in the process.	23	49cd1fd7-1d12-4c36-ab69-e9eb0ae43cd8	2026-08-27 07:09:17.834+00	2026-08-27 07:55:59.699+00	9	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q1rgkoSwN4epVcYk8kiD9vmO0ef.jpg	7	2024-03-01 00:00:00+00
