ce1f1870-7261-4469-96a9-310fd7851c0f	When The Wind Blows	LFG has declared they are withdrawing all investment in Miracle Entertainment. Unable to accept it, I went to talk to the CEO, Victor, in person and was presented with two conditions to the reinstatement of our funding. In order to meet Victor's conditions, I continue gathering information on the mysterious warping incidents. Between Lucien, who has become a consultant on the show, and a police officer who witnessed my involvement in the incident with the boy while I was out investigating, I manage to assemble some information, but...	23	808335dd-64c0-4921-af55-0e3672f4ccbb	2026-08-27 07:14:10.091+00	2026-08-27 08:00:09.52+00	2	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fMlSYOSIN5FXqruUivFEA5jaDcW.jpg	8	2020-07-23 00:00:00+00
b9ec9235-3481-462d-af24-422b7f8e6534	A Taste of Reminiscence	A boost provided by super-popular idol Kiro posting about us on social media helps me to clear Victor's first condition, using the "mysterious warping incidents" as material for our show. Riding that momentum, I take my business plan to Victor, but he shoots it down, saying it lacks concrete specifics. While looking for an idea suitable for development among the ones we already have in-house, my gaze lands on a proposal concerning a restaurant with extremely mixed reviews - a restaurant called "Souvenir."	23	808335dd-64c0-4921-af55-0e3672f4ccbb	2026-08-27 07:14:10.093+00	2026-08-27 08:00:09.521+00	3	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xuQItLkpQjZIzLlML2BT1gSCg8b.jpg	8	2020-07-30 00:00:00+00
50198a32-dccc-44be-82c4-e9be49cc442d	The Key in the Darkness	With financing from LFG reinstated, Miracle Entertainment is riding the momentum from Kiro's appearance on the show. Meanwhile, Evolvers appear one after another around me. Plus, there's the riddle of the mysterious organization "Black Swan." As my daily life slowly begins to change, I start investigating the topic of our next show, Key, a "hacker for justice" who's name was in my father's notebook.	23	808335dd-64c0-4921-af55-0e3672f4ccbb	2026-08-27 07:14:10.094+00	2026-08-27 08:00:09.522+00	4	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tViux7mJ6vQz4ff0FNGVTHWPSXk.jpg	8	2020-08-06 00:00:00+00
7d37043b-3c52-4289-96a3-466fb092777a	An Amber Wind	Memories I can't recall... My father's death... and connected to everything, Black Swan. As I chase after the ever deepening mystery, I learn of a disappearance connected to my old high school. At the same time, after deciding to make the theme of our next show "letters" to tie in to a current hit movie, I head out to look into a ramen shop near my old high school. Along with research for the show, I feel I need to investigate the disappearance and head toward the high school, but...	23	808335dd-64c0-4921-af55-0e3672f4ccbb	2026-08-27 07:14:10.095+00	2026-08-27 08:00:09.523+00	5	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ofqkFs9Uazd9WQGxkxtiVbp8xZf.jpg	7	2020-08-13 00:00:00+00
06964c52-3729-458c-9080-c13266ec7057	Beyond That Dream	I thought Lucien was taking me to do some research for "Miracle Finder," but the road we travel stretches on and on through peaceful countryside. Refusing to tell me what we're researching, Lucien proposes a picnic for a change of pace. Meanwhile, after hearing from Shaw, someone allied with Black Swan, that there are rumors of a darker side to the Task Force, Gavin starts investigating things on his own.	23	808335dd-64c0-4921-af55-0e3672f4ccbb	2026-08-27 07:14:10.096+00	2026-08-27 08:00:09.523+00	6	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g5kwavA9FN7GsYGqoGw5KTM7mIl.jpg	7	2020-08-20 00:00:00+00
48af5996-160d-4ed7-9b75-ba1e79661225	Connected Memories	A request has come in from HBS, a big American broadcasting company, to work on a show together. Knowing we have to make the most of this chance, I manage to convince the first guest, LFG's CEO, Zen, to participate and we move toward filming. On the day of the shoot, I'm taken on a tour of the set to go over the content of the show. Somehow, I end up locked up alone in one of the set's jail rooms! In that moment, my memories begin to awaken...	23	808335dd-64c0-4921-af55-0e3672f4ccbb	2026-08-27 07:14:10.097+00	2026-08-27 08:00:09.524+00	7	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v58ZZHj3dLhxtrxwA0AgYNqfARd.jpg	7	2020-08-27 00:00:00+00
a09d42c0-b6e9-4b16-83a8-9299f08db469	Room 404	In my dream, I saw room 404 of the Greenwood Hotel engulfed in flames, and lying collapsed in the middle of it, Haku. My unease sends me to the hotel I'd seen in my dream, but when I arrive, I'm told they have no room 404. Unable to erase the fear from my heart, I head up to the fourth floor to investigate and I find something that shouldn't exist - room 404.	23	808335dd-64c0-4921-af55-0e3672f4ccbb	2026-08-27 07:14:10.098+00	2026-08-27 08:00:09.524+00	8	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vOFLeQHWrsT7ePpkmPU6kCQ9XfC.jpg	7	2020-09-03 00:00:00+00
4f381c99-79c8-40c1-aee1-b5881a6166ae	Monochrome	With his evol gone out of control, Gavin takes himself away from me. Around the same time, as a result of his fans going berserk, Kira announces his retirement, and no one can get in touch with Victor, who has gone missing. Our company receives tips on incidents which might be caused by evols which have gone out of control. In search of a clue as to some way of stopping the evols from running wild, I head to the university where Lucien works.	23	808335dd-64c0-4921-af55-0e3672f4ccbb	2026-08-27 07:14:10.099+00	2026-08-27 08:00:09.525+00	9	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gHO0PKiZNsy2FfXS0ZHp36qLPT6.jpg	7	2020-09-10 00:00:00+00
0e076b7c-eb95-4d89-851e-034ddf7b594c	Dawn of Farewell	I've learned a truth I don't want to believe, but I can't allow myself to stop now. I keep running. To block the electromagnetic waves causing evols to go out of control, I head to Loveland TV Tower. When I arrive, enforcement teams from Black Swan are already there. Left with no help, and no path left to take... behind me appears someone who was supposed to be missing.	23	808335dd-64c0-4921-af55-0e3672f4ccbb	2026-08-27 07:14:10.1+00	2026-08-27 08:00:09.526+00	10	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dmLfvxIU3Jz7N9C3nFNd74w2oP8.jpg	7	2020-09-17 00:00:00+00
6efc22b2-2931-4b82-9b20-bb57ea84d8bc	The Misfit of Demon King Academy	"Listen up, my beloved descendants. Your founding ancestor has returned." The most powerful Demon King in history, Anos, known for his tyrannical rule 2000 years ago, has been reincarnated. Entrance exams are being held at the Demon King Academy where they train his descendants to be his successor and become Demon Lords. The entrance exam is a practical test where students must duel each other. Bored of the war-torn world of 2000 years ago, the tyrannical Demon King, Anos, appears on the scene.	24	2c258e13-3f45-4b9e-8d07-9e1b7191e990	2026-08-27 07:08:09.134+00	2026-08-27 08:00:10.592+00	1	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8omTdSkGQAnvS2Teq7q4N5bTwe5.jpg	6	2020-07-04 00:00:00+00
bb7426b1-b51e-419c-a52b-e3b104f848c8	The Witch of Destruction	Though he is the founding ancestor and possesses enormous magical powers, Anos is cast as a misfit at the Academy. Unperturbed by this unjust treatment, he continues to demonstrate his overwhelming powers and takes part in the team competition exam as a leader. His classmates mock him for being a hybrid, and the only teammate he can find is Misha. Their rival team is led by Sasha, Misha’s older sister, who looks down on Misha and calls her a "junk doll."	24	2c258e13-3f45-4b9e-8d07-9e1b7191e990	2026-08-27 07:08:09.137+00	2026-08-27 08:00:10.592+00	2	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1wFdgrS3zyalpYcHzDfyaeG0CuC.jpg	6	2020-07-11 00:00:00+00
f30eb349-94fb-4327-ad51-f51680f57d21	Sasha’s True Intentions	"One last thing, I’m glad I got to meet you." Without being able to understand Sasha’s true intent behind these final words, much time has passed, and Ivis, one of the Seven Elder Demon Emperors, holds a special class at the Demon King Academy called the Great Magic Training. The Seven Elder Demon Emperors are seven demons that Anos, the founding ancestor, created from his own blood. Emilia implores Anos to act respectfully to Ivis, but without hesitation, he speaks to Ivis in a condescending tone.	24	2c258e13-3f45-4b9e-8d07-9e1b7191e990	2026-08-27 07:08:09.138+00	2026-08-27 08:00:10.593+00	3	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AnxXHDup6Zsk6Hrei687HG23XIo.jpg	6.286	2020-07-18 00:00:00+00
