ec0f1b49-0346-4953-9bf7-f08d26561000	Senpai Says...	Kaito seems to be frustrated with his failed attempt to confess to Ichika, so he decides to ditch school, telling her to leave him alone for awhile. Worried, Kanna goes to visit him at his house. It turned out into a date as the two went to Karuizawa. Ichika sees them from a distance and follows them. Kanna had to leave Kaito when she finds out Lemon has been filming their "date." It so happened that Ichika crosses paths with Kaito. Nervous of the prospect that she wants to talk to him, he runs away from her, and a chase ensues. It was all about a misunderstanding--that Kaito wants to know Ichika's secret, while Ichika wants to know who dumped Kaito. When Kaito took some footage of Ichika, it turned out into some sort of an informal confession. Shocked, Kaito stops filming her.	24	d28d54b5-e537-46c8-9a8a-a986cb64f38a	2026-08-27 07:16:21.595+00	2026-08-27 08:01:48.022+00	3	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rMzjueSpsJuz3sWeCyZ0FRBtGxf.jpg	8.5	2012-01-24 00:00:00+00
defa0164-6672-443f-b88b-8cdbc10ba636	Senpai Was Amazing	Things turn awkward the next day, but they try to put it behind them. More complications arrive when Manami, Tetsurō's married sister, takes a homebound Kaito for shopping. Ichika sees them, and followed them via teleportation with Rinon's help, even at her place. Worried about what will happen next, Ichika enters and tries to take him home...though not without clashing a bit with Manami, acting like an overprotective lover, until Tetsurō comes to clear things up, that Manami is already married, and she's here because of a petty quarrel with her husband. As an apology Ichika asked Kaito for a favor from him. He asked if she could help him review for the finals, to which she agreed, and helped him study until the final day of exams.	24	d28d54b5-e537-46c8-9a8a-a986cb64f38a	2026-08-27 07:16:21.596+00	2026-08-27 08:01:48.023+00	4	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Z22Erpeuj0VLTkcGv3Cq1KKwaK.jpg	8.5	2012-01-31 00:00:00+00
