5b946172-a64e-4a3b-b831-6355f90cdd50	An Observation Log of the Self-Proclaimed Villainess's Debut into Society	Bertia struggles to correct the scenario she has unintentionally altered. At the same time, Cecil enters Halm Academy, a boarding school. During this time in which the two of them spend more and more time apart, Bertia's mother becomes pregnant and it leaves Bertia worried about one thing.	24	bbd15db5-342e-478a-b708-edf941d8b9c6	2026-08-27 05:31:35.363+00	2026-08-27 07:53:10.358+00	2	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AimSGj5g3fTlcPvrfZTx6gKd4yo.jpg	7	2026-04-13 00:00:00+00
a99671da-8de6-45f6-952e-26665a56ac8e	An Observation Log of a Self-Proclaimed Villainess and Entering School.	Time passes and Bertia enrolls at Halm Academy, the same school as Cecil. At the same time, Heronia, the heroine of the otome game, also enrolls there. Wishing for a happy ending for Cecil, Bertia fights to bring the two of them together.	24	bbd15db5-342e-478a-b708-edf941d8b9c6	2026-08-27 05:31:35.365+00	2026-08-27 07:53:10.359+00	3	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9cDtRCpKSd1oiKVRp6s3j4ChHbD.jpg	7	2026-04-20 00:00:00+00
adf598fa-4b97-4ba5-845d-ae4facb3e120	An Observation Log of a Self-Proclaimed Villainess and Love's Cupid.	In order for Cecil to find happiness with Heronia, avoiding the reverse harem route is essential. For that reason, Bertia has decided to become love's cupid, pairing Cecil's personal aide candidates with other noble ladies.	24	bbd15db5-342e-478a-b708-edf941d8b9c6	2026-08-27 05:31:35.367+00	2026-08-27 07:53:10.359+00	4	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/slNpzyBKx8Rg6QGgtw1Af0tHBFn.jpg	7	2026-04-27 00:00:00+00
