d5689dbc-52c5-4751-96e6-d227454560ce	Summer's Staples! (The Fanservice Episode, Frankly)	Miss Kobayashi and the others go to the beach. But Lucoa's immediately dragged off by one of the lifeguards for her overly skimpy swimsuit. After regrouping, they put sunscreen on each other, split a watermelon, go swimming together, and enjoy summer to the fullest. After the beach, it's comiket! Tohru and Miss Kobayashi both head for the otaku's battlefield, and even Tohru gets shivers from the incredible aura surrounding those otaku. While helping Takiya with his circle, Tohru's horns and wings are mistaken as cosplay?!	24	d8d59ec2-a365-40a2-969a-7adde94ff259	2026-08-27 07:12:36.145+00	2026-08-27 08:02:17.104+00	7	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/acfqFi5GI9Axc7mGAsSIDY9FGYy.jpg	7.5	2017-02-23 00:00:00+00
