0775a8da-53c0-425b-92c9-a84bcf928d0a	The 99-Legged Bug	The town of Domori may be plagued by mysterious phenomena, but things are not going well for Class 5-3's new homeroom teacher Meisuke Nueno, either. Right from the start, Nueno, or "Nube" for short, becomes the target of fifth-grader Hiroshi's bursts of rage. After witnessing something bizarre, Nueno suspects there may be an otherworldly reason behind Hiroshi's sudden personality change.	23	148372bf-9e1d-4ca1-bbaa-49f41cc3e548	2026-08-27 06:48:27.812+00	2026-08-27 07:37:20.616+00	1	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bSbfeSCqd2NZxmgaPu6aHVVPmgn.jpg	7.3	2025-07-02 00:00:00+00
