50f27109-6715-458c-b4ff-a92e78a6755b	Great Inventions and Spirit World Communicators	Young inventor Akira finds a broken tablet and becomes even more obsessed with building great machines, as if he is possessed by something. One day, Akira announces he can bring the dead back to life, scaring his friends. Nueno senses something is wrong and investigates Akira's inventions, when he notices something strange within Akira's tablet...	23	148372bf-9e1d-4ca1-bbaa-49f41cc3e548	2026-08-27 06:48:27.819+00	2026-08-27 07:37:20.624+00	8	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ppP6w0XWAo7yvUBKx7ksUQDLAbu.jpg	7	2025-08-20 00:00:00+00
00178e2a-1f7c-4358-876c-2152b5851011	The Girl Who Brings Happiness	One day, Nube meets a little girl in town. She is a Zashiki Warashi, a spirit that brings good fortune to people. The Zashiki Warashi becomes attached to Nube and follows him to school. From that day on, unexpected good fortune begins to befall his classmates one after another. However, as he sees how the students in his class gradually forget about hard work and start relying on good fortune, Nube finds it difficult to say goodbye to the Zashiki Warashi, but...	23	148372bf-9e1d-4ca1-bbaa-49f41cc3e548	2026-08-27 06:48:27.82+00	2026-08-27 07:37:20.624+00	9	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ptXb3mpPFAjGm2fR9wx2eZkAr0c.jpg	7	2025-08-27 00:00:00+00
afb01cec-6a7c-41df-8e1a-33054d6ea7d1	The Night Parade of Yokai	Born into a wealthy family, Shuichi carelessly tosses aside anything he no longer needs. He has long forgotten the importance of caring for his belongings until one day, he unwittingly picks up a tattered yellow umbrella. The umbrella suddenly reveals itself as a yokai and kidnaps Shuichi, forcing him to join an array of discarded objects in the Night Parade of Yokai.	23	148372bf-9e1d-4ca1-bbaa-49f41cc3e548	2026-08-27 06:48:27.821+00	2026-08-27 07:37:20.626+00	10	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ac8nRoKMBek8fLa9gKy5SORv79n.jpg	7	2025-09-03 00:00:00+00
2b316c78-cf9a-429e-8c55-36634694cff9	Demon Hand vs Fire Tail Jutsu	Tamamo, the fox demon Nube vanquished for trying to take Hiroshi's skull, reappears one day at Domori Elementary. When a furious Nube confronts him, Tamamo says he is no longer interested in Hiroshi and declares a temporary truce. However, he suddenly attacks the students of Class 5-3. It soon becomes apparent that Tamamo's true target is not the students, but Nube's special power.	23	148372bf-9e1d-4ca1-bbaa-49f41cc3e548	2026-08-27 06:48:27.822+00	2026-08-27 07:37:20.627+00	11	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wFG7cSDb8ghsHoeKP03dmbh4sat.jpg	7	2025-09-10 00:00:00+00
bff9c23a-a3f3-4c8d-9f14-4e80920d5d5b	Spirit Beast vs Spirit Fish	Remugyo, a giant spirit monster, appears at Domori Elementary and lays eggs on the backs of Nube's students. Knowing the eggs will kill them once they hatch, Nube faces a nightmare worsened by Remugyo's terrifying ability to regenerate. As Tamamo attempts to learn the secret to Nube's incredible power, the eggs begin to hatch. Nube bets his life on one last desperate attempt to save his students.	23	148372bf-9e1d-4ca1-bbaa-49f41cc3e548	2026-08-27 06:48:27.823+00	2026-08-27 07:37:20.628+00	12	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ofur4Li5QUaIp7JVnTnFEOzRBAp.jpg	7	2025-09-17 00:00:00+00
