2bfcda52-218a-4502-b390-e2d1f3f78efe	Act One - Meeting	The Edo period. Daughter of a martial arts dojo, Rin embarks on a journey to take revenge for her slain parents. For her bodyguard on the journey, she has chosen the immortal man Manji, nicknamed the Slayer of Hundreds. Her target is the head of the Ittou-ryu, Kagehisa Anotsu, the man she hates. The adventure of the man who never dies and the girl who's sworn to live for revenge unfolds.	24	94dc7053-05a7-41e3-9dbf-5688a71ba442	2026-08-27 06:57:04.898+00	2026-08-27 07:44:11.494+00	1	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xpXSTZGGpd45TaJ5AsltW8za5dz.jpg	\N	2019-10-10 00:00:00+00
