cd77d7f6-b8a6-413d-a385-8860fc91ac6c	Her Homesickness	If Mashiro and Nanami weren’t enough, Sorata has to deal with someone who has known him all his life. The jealousy between these three rivals will bring Sorata to his knees.	23	4e439194-58ce-4068-8dcd-4df01a543c87	2026-08-27 07:18:19.682+00	2026-08-27 08:03:12.143+00	7	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pLeI6EBMC7Ax19ftB33FUAC0usW.jpg	6.8	2012-11-20 00:00:00+00
