372331d0-911f-4147-8cf0-46af8838625f	Season 1	Serafina de Lavillant, the strongest knight of the West, leads an expedition to conquer the barbaric tribes of the East. However, when the mission ends in a crushing defeat, she is captured alive and dragged back to the enemy's stronghold. Preparing herself for the most brutal and humiliating torture imaginable, Serafina is left completely stunned when the barbaric king, Veor, suddenly approaches her and... proposes. Forced into this arranged marriage, she gradually begins to realize that these eastern tribes are not nearly as savage as her kingdom had led her to believe.	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1RH3ehjBSXvOBLwRemk02ryiGwp.jpg	2026-08-27 05:31:20.093+00	2026-08-27 07:52:54.615+00	1	SYNCED	46c8deb0-ec31-422f-af7e-aee1929c9905	completed
91d3e100-ea41-44a9-8be2-18396cf73477	Season 1	Season 1 kicks off right after the brutal massacre of the Hojo clan in Kamakura. Young Tokiyuki is rescued by the enigmatic priest Suwa Yorishige and hidden away in the peaceful region of Suwa. Forced to conceal his royal identity under a pseudonym, he begins forming a tight-knit band of young loyal allies known as the "Elusive Warriors." To prepare for his grand revenge against the usurper Ashikaga Takauji, Tokiyuki must learn to weaponize his incredible, natural talent for fleeing and dodging into a survival strategy in this chaotic era.	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wVJjyUbns2USXo1bolF2vGanvf6.jpg	2026-08-27 07:08:24.137+00	2026-08-27 07:55:10.805+00	1	SYNCED	591b3147-9332-4cbd-a8fc-eae84ba15588	completed
0d194392-5fed-4dcf-9aa2-0ab2c567b0d1	Season 1	Set in a city of scientifically advanced superhuman students, but in a world where magic is also real. Touma Kamijou’s right hand, the Imagine Breaker, will negate all magic, psychic, or divine powers, but not his own bad luck.\n\nOne day he finds a young girl hanging on his balcony railing. She turns out to be a nun from the Church of England, and her mind has been implanted with the Index-Librorum-Prohibitorum - all the magical texts the Church has removed from circulation.	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4TvhWtBEphk9sBJraEz8D4kJqhl.jpg	2026-08-27 07:17:09.544+00	2026-08-27 08:04:40.1+00	1	SYNCED	0915f315-b9ca-432b-bf12-8b562515e4fa	completed
