e13be895-f90a-4ae3-8bfa-d89ac973c6ae	Season 4	This season contains a single story arc, titled "Dai Matō Enbu" (大魔闘演武, lit "Grand Magic Games"), which adapts material from the beginning of the 31st through the ending of the 35th volumes of Hiro Mashima's Fairy Tail manga over 25 episodes. Focusing on Natsu and the others who were frozen in time for seven years on Sirius Island, the members return to Magnolia and discover that Saber Tooth is the strongest guild in the Fiore Kingdom. Having become the weakest guild during the absence of its core members, Fairy Tail decides to enter the Grand Magic Games, an annual competition to decide Fiore's strongest guild.	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yg3gHDXReJuI2WEdJ7qLXRWew3f.jpg	2026-08-27 06:58:04.886+00	2026-08-27 07:46:47.339+00	4	SYNCED	20f9ebac-4402-432f-ad5c-f538378f8680	completed
