36aa5b0b-bb81-4c41-bc86-b404b2743f7b	Season 1	Born into a prestigious family of master swordsmen, Elymas Edvaughn's future shatters when he awakens the so-called "defective" Heavy Knight class. Disowned and cast out, he regains memories of another life—and realizes this world mirrors a VR game he once mastered. Armed with knowledge no one else possesses, he sets out to rewrite his fate and prove the strength of the "weakest" class.	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bADzMfofNWYdxLnlqNuMkO6du34.jpg	2026-08-28 05:09:15.763+00	2026-08-30 11:52:47.371+00	1	SYNCED	35672ff2-7d55-4645-8912-44253933cd94	ongoing
15ba6faf-52a6-464a-b886-d9b1a7fc28f5	4th Season: Second Year, First Semester	As Ayanokouji and his classmates begin their second year at the Advanced Nurturing High School, they're greeted by a fresh gauntlet of exams and a fresh batch of rather unique first-year students. They'll have to get to know each other quickly, because the first special exam pairs the first-years with the second-years on a written test—with only the second-years facing expulsion if their team performs poorly! Worse yet? It seems one of the new first-years is also from the White Room. Can Ayanokouji avoid expulsion while sussing out the identity of this hidden foe?	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dw0NOXvhRBYk8NNmZrFEOo4UdPf.jpg	2026-08-27 05:31:14.965+00	2026-08-27 08:03:19.27+00	4	SYNCED	09863886-cd19-45eb-bcb8-818682b17936	completed
765d28c0-d973-48bd-8165-132a68d52efa	Season 2	Ever since the quiet and timid Reina Aharen enrolled in high school, she has made new friends and even started dating her classmate Raidou. When the two begin their second year, everything seems to be going well, as they are seatmates once more. Soon after, a transfer student named Riku Tamanaha joins their class. Unbeknownst to Reina, the outgoing and stylish girl is actually a childhood friend she separated from years ago. With Raidou's support, Reina is able to rekindle their friendship. Although they have grown closer, Raidou and Reina still struggle to communicate due to his overactive imagination and her difficulty with expressing herself. Nevertheless, the eccentric couple continues to brighten up the lives of people around them as they enjoy each other's company to the fullest.	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kehJiEINzW4witVFGUFDRAlwjYO.jpg	2026-08-27 06:48:45.894+00	2026-08-27 07:40:30.6+00	2	SYNCED	23c8f8a4-f867-4a66-9421-2642752d751b	completed
2f91587c-c233-48e6-a11b-f462e21a2fd2	Season 1	Meet Arisu Yamabuki, heir to a powerful conglomerate who seeks perfection in life. He listened to the radio program Midnight Heart Tune until the host, Apollo, vanished. Upon enrolling at Furin High and joining the broadcasting club, he meets four girls hoping to make a living off their voices. Arisu promises to make their vocal dreams come true and honor the promise he once made to Apollo.	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/af58wkrH7fiO7HtH1uysxmUR882.jpg	2026-08-27 07:06:06.237+00	2026-08-27 07:53:15.135+00	1	SYNCED	b0db548f-30c3-405b-ac80-5ce37fd54e57	completed
07b3e3af-cedd-4fd7-ad59-12a795909a5d	RISE FROM EMBER	Focusing on the conflict in Chernobog as the Reunion Movement, led by Talulah, attacks the city. Rhodes Island, led by Amiya, stands as the last neutral force against Reunion and attempts to navigate the escalating chaos to prevent widespread destruction. The season covers Chapters 7 and 8 of the game's story, exploring both intense action and emotional moments as the characters confront the consequences of the growing conflict.	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kRaE0uUaINUSFBd14gFSzhzB25l.jpg	2026-08-27 06:48:39.484+00	2026-08-27 07:40:15.529+00	3	SYNCED	dabb680e-a8c1-47ed-aac0-e7a16cf8ac97	completed
d4ade6c7-932b-4af9-b235-86846007feb1	Season 1	Botan Kamiina is a 20-year-old freshman who has just moved into a rather unique all-female dormitory to start her college life. There, she encounters an eccentric group of roommates who share one passionate bond: an absolute love for drinking and gourmet bar snacks. Initially timid and reserved, Botan's ordinary campus life takes a vibrant turn when her seniors introduce her to the delightful world of alcohol. With every glass poured, the drinks act as a catalyst, allowing Botan's true, uninhibited personality to beautifully "blossom." Thus begins a heartwarming and hilarious slice-of-life comedy about friendship, laughter, and unforgettable drunken nights among girls.	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bYwXdvv8o2csyVXDRmSgeWIij0f.jpg	2026-08-27 05:31:19.333+00	2026-08-27 07:52:53.54+00	1	SYNCED	62f87b74-a025-4760-b238-8de647a791d0	completed
44a3f01d-cbc9-4f65-9d31-21149b9ebe04	Season 2	Great Tree Village has grown far beyond the small farm Hiraku once built in the wilderness. As waves of new immigrants arrive seeking refuge, the village faces the challenges of rapid expansion, from housing diverse races such as minotaurs, centaurs, and forest spirits to managing new farmland, resources, and community needs. Between welcoming newcomers, hosting tournaments and festivals, exploring hot springs, and strengthening ties with neighboring powers, Hiraku's dream of a peaceful rural life becomes busier—and livelier—than ever. As the village continues to evolve into a thriving multicultural settlement, every day brings new faces, new projects, and new adventures.	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kev8htXH2mvYZvl16sBvgvw84vp.jpg	2026-08-27 05:31:34.599+00	2026-08-27 07:57:30.683+00	2	SYNCED	7042688a-f297-48f2-92d0-d3f6eb844ceb	completed
